/*
  ResponseViewer.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0041 · ResponseViewer (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `ResponseViewer` (and the exported `ResponseSnippetPanel`) resolves (table
  "ResponseViewer") lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English value.
  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/admin/components/ResponseViewer.tsx, incl. the exported SnippetPanel).
  The second group backs the native chrome (VoiceOver labels + disclosure state)
  so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

